# The pinned third-party notices, staged here by
# third_party/libghostty-vt/scripts/stage-notices.sh — from `make vt-archives`,
# which is also what verifies the bytes against MANIFEST.json — and embedded by
# //go:embed all:licenses.
#
# The document itself is never committed: the pin is the release, and the
# release is where a consumer gets it. This committed file is what lets a fresh
# checkout COMPILE — the `all:` prefix includes dotfiles, so the embed always
# matches at least this file, and notices.Document answers ErrNotBuilt until
# the document is staged.
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt
